---
// Hero section with white background - two column layout
---

<section
  class="relative min-h-[95vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 via-blue-50 to-sky-100"
>
  <!-- Content Container -->
  <div
    class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center py-12"
  >
    <!-- Left Column - Content -->
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-left">
      <!-- Title -->
      <h1
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-6 animate-fade-up"
      >
        <span class="font-light block mb-2">PURIFICADOR</span>
        <span
          class="font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-cyan-600 to-blue-700 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
        >
          DE AGUA
        </span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Info Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-amber-100 px-4 sm:px-6 py-5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-2 border-orange-300">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-600">
              LA NUEVA ERA EN PURIFICACIÓN
            </p>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl text-slate-900 font-black leading-tight">
              Desinfección Cuántica
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-orange-700 font-medium">
              Tecnología exclusiva Purifreze
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-blue-200">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock text-cyan-600 text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Te instalamos el equipo en un <span class="font-bold text-cyan-700">máximo de 48 horas</span>, con costo de instalación de <span class="font-bold text-green-700">$0 pesos</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-purple-50 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-purple-200">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-wrench text-purple-600 text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Todos los <span class="font-bold text-purple-700">mantenimientos preventivos y correctivos</span> están incluidos dentro de la renta, <span class="font-bold text-green-700">sin cargos adicionales</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Button -->
      <div class="animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5219991336108"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group inline-flex bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-black text-base sm:text-lg tracking-wide shadow-2xl shadow-green-500/40 hover:shadow-green-500/60 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 hover:-translate-y-1 items-center gap-3 w-fit"
        >
          <i
            class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-2xl group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform"
          ></i>
          AGENDAR VISITA GRATIS
          <i
            class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform"
          ></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column - Image -->
    <div
      class="flex items-center justify-center animate-fade-up"
      style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"
    >
      <img
        src="/assets/imagen3.png"
        alt="Mujer disfrutando agua purificada en su cocina con sistema Purifreze"
        class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-2xl"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scroll Indicator -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-2xl"></i>
  </div>
</section>
